# GMS's own figures: 75+5x% fourteen times on ONE enemy, and 3+floor(x/6)% of
# the pool back with every cast. The bossing swing, and the only one in the
# book that hits a single target.
#
# The heal is GMS's party heal, and pays the party the same share it pays the
# Bishop. Theirs rides this swing alone -- a Bishop mobbing with Big Bang
# recovers nothing, see SkillEffect.hp_recover_pct -- but an ally's is folded
# in as a passive, so it lands on their own swings rather than on the casts
# they cannot see. Nothing in a boss fight hits the player, so it pays only
# once the party can farm together.
name: "Angel Ray"
skill_order: 1
description:
  "Attack with a holy sword, dealing tremendous holy damage. Restores party "
  "members' HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 1
lines: 14
base {
  skill_pct: 0.80
  hp_recover_pct: 0.022
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.05
  hp_recover_pct: 0.002
}
ally_base { hp_recover_pct: 0.022 }
ally_per_level { hp_recover_pct: 0.002 }
